[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **The C library has no error surface.** `to_barycentric` takes four
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m by-value `lm_vec2` structs (eight `float`s), is branch-free, and returns a
