[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * **F. exact-vs-rounded arithmetic** — small integer coordinates (all
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   intermediates exact in binary32) vs values whose products round.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
